flowchart TB
accTitle: Publishing and confirming a cast
accDescr: An app key signs a cast in the browser. The client service forwards signed bytes to the read node. Validators commit the message, the node applies its block, and the browser confirms the result.
browser["1 · App key signs a cast"]:::device
subgraph S["Your AWS server"]
 client["2 · Client passes signed bytes"]:::service
 node[("3 · Read node forwards message")]:::data
end
validators["4 · Validators commit a block"]:::network
applied[("5 · Same node applies the block")]:::data
confirmed["6 · Browser confirms the result"]:::done
browser -->|"HTTPS · private key stays behind"| client
client --> node
node --> validators
validators --> applied
applied -->|"Client checks the matching result"| confirmed
